01:12:30.510 --> 01:12:35.420
Well, we'll get along. Whitefield's doing a song of mine right now, and that's only a stalker.

01:12:35.830 --> 01:12:38.510
Why, I'll write musical comedy reviews. I'll work. I'll...

01:12:38.510 --> 01:12:39.410
You'll starve?

